71
00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:05.533
But let's see how it goes.

72
00:04:05.533 --> 00:04:10.533
So you can see here that the LLM
returned food nine times out of ten.

73
00:04:11.033 --> 00:04:14.033
But this one time
