the constraint topic validator.

115
00:06:41.966 --> 00:06:46.533
And we basically taken a list
of banned topics and a threshold value.

116
00:06:47.033 --> 00:06:50.066
And then in our validate function
we're calling

117
00:06:50.066 --> 00:06:53.133
our detect topics function
that we implemented earlier.

118
00:06:53.466 --> 00:06:58.133
And if any banned topics are detected
we raise a fail result.

119
00:06:58.366 --> 00:07:00.533
Otherwise, we raise a pass result.

120
00:07:00.533 --> 00:07:03.766
Pretty straightforward and similar to what
